    [
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.041,
                0.068,
                0.949,
                0.147
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Traditional cost levers can often generate savings of 5% to 25% within the first 3 to 12 months, creating the runway for deeper investment. This creates a powerful cycle. Traditional savings fund AI transformation. AI transformation facilitates structural efficiency. Structural efficiency creates additional investment capacity. Over time, this advantage will pay dividends.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.042,
                0.161,
                0.947,
                0.261
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Be flexible in scaling investments. Many organizations still demand highly detailed business cases before scaling their investment. The intention is understandable, but excessive precision can become a strategic constraint in fast-moving environments. Those that are pulling ahead are willing to invest before fully mapping out all returns. They understand how transformation creates second-order effects that are impossible to fully model in advance.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.055,
                0.31,
                0.636,
                0.35
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Excessive precision can become a strategic constraint in fast-moving environments.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.042,
                0.423,
                0.929,
                0.502
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "This does not mean scaling blindly. It means making smarter bets, watching what works, and moving innovation and other budget lines quickly toward the areas with the greatest impact. Leaders don’t wait to prove every dollar of return in advance. They build momentum, learn fast, and scale the use cases that create real value.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.042,
                0.553,
                0.949,
                0.654
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Some companies will continue to focus on AI costs, running cheap pilots and hesitating to commit. But the true advantage from the technology will go to those that recognize its full potential and redesign their business accordingly. That requires leadership conviction, organizational commitment, and sustained investment, and it’s how AI leaders give themselves a competitive edge that compounds over time.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.043,
                0.723,
                0.436,
                0.741
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "ABOUT BOSTON CONSULTING GROUP"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.041,
                0.758,
                0.952,
                0.878
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Boston Consulting Group bridges the gap between ambition and outcomes for the world's leading companies and organizations. We are built for this era of unprecedented change — bringing strategic clarity rooted in over 60 years of deep domain knowledge, combined with applied AI shaped by our practitioners. BCG works shoulder-to-shoulder with CEOs across industries and geographies to deliver transformative impact at scale: stronger returns, transferred capabilities, and change that sticks. For more information, visit bcg.com.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
